### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Microservicio Catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/microservices/products/P-101

### 2. Microservicio Inventario
GET {{baseUrl}}/microservices/inventory/P-101

### 3. API externa (Frankfurter)
GET https://api.frankfurter.app/latest?from=USD&to=MXN

### 4. Composite API - éxito
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-summary/P-101

### 5. Composite API - sin stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-summary/P-102

### 6. Composite API - producto inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/product-summary/NOPE
